        <ExplanationTxt>THE FORM 990 IS REVIEWED AND APPROVED BY THE FINANCE COMMITTEE PRIOR TO SUBMISSION TO THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS. AFTER DISTRIBUTION TO THE BOARD, FORM 990 IS THEN SUBMITTED TO THE IRS.</ExplanationTxt>
