      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 12C</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>AS PART OF THE ANNUAL MEETING EACH BOARD MEMBER AND KEY EMPLOYEE IS REQUIRED TO COMPLETE A CONFLICT OF INTEREST DISCLOSURE FORM.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 15</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THERE IS NO COMPENSATION PROVIDED TO DIRECTORS, OR MEMBERS OF THE BOARD. AS PART OF THE ANNUAL BUDGET PROCESS THE SALARY OF THE CEO IS REVIEWED AND APPROVED BY THE FINANCE COMMITTEE AND THE EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE. THE FULL BOARD APPROVES THE SALARY AS PART OF THE BUDGET APPROVAL PROCESS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
